---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Upperkai"
  description="How Upperkai Ventures collects, uses and protects personal information on the Upperkai website."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: [date]</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container narrow prose" aria-label="Policy text">
    <p>[Have this policy reviewed by a lawyer for the countries you operate in before publishing. Text in square brackets needs your details.]</p>
    <p>This policy explains how Upperkai Ventures ("Upperkai", "we", "us") handles personal information collected through this website, upperkai.com. Each Upperkai product has its own privacy policy, which applies when you use that product.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Messages you send us.</strong> When you use the contact form we receive your name, email address, the topic you chose and your message.</li>
      <li><strong>Newsletter sign-ups.</strong> If you subscribe to updates we keep your email address.</li>
      <li><strong>Emails.</strong> If you write to hello@upperkai.com or support@upperkai.com we receive your message and email address.</li>
      <li><strong>Server logs.</strong> Our hosting provider records basic technical information, such as IP addresses and the pages requested, to keep the site running and secure.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This website does not use advertising or analytics cookies. [Update this if you add analytics.]</p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To reply to your messages and requests.</li>
      <li>To send the updates you subscribed to. Every email includes a way to unsubscribe.</li>
      <li>To keep the website secure and working properly.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>We use a small number of service providers to run this website, such as our hosting and form provider [Netlify, Inc.] and our email provider [email provider]. They process information on our behalf and only as we instruct. We may also disclose information where the law requires it.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep messages for as long as we need them to deal with your enquiry and for a reasonable period afterwards. Newsletter addresses are kept until you unsubscribe. [Adjust to your retention periods.]</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete your personal information, to object to how we use it, or to complain to a data protection authority. To make a request, email <a href="mailto:hello@upperkai.com">hello@upperkai.com</a>. [Name the data protection law and authority that apply to Upperkai Ventures.]</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If we change this policy we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Upperkai Ventures, [registered address]. Email: <a href="mailto:hello@upperkai.com">hello@upperkai.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
